## The two halves of each paired move were authored apart, and placed at
## fixed offsets their bodies passed through each other (PairClearance: 32 of
## 37 moves, up to 26 cm). GrappleRig's separation eases the models apart at
## runtime; the fit records, at each trajectory key, how far each role's model
## had to be moved -- in the pair frame -- and bakes it into the root keys
